{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15529","headline":"九日陪皇甫使君泛江宴赤岸亭 · 畅当","name":"九日陪皇甫使君泛江宴赤岸亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羁旅逢佳节，逍遥忽见招。\n同倾菊花酒，缓櫂木兰桡。\n平楚堪愁思，长江去寂寥。\n猿啼不离峡，滩沸镇如潮。\n举目关山异，伤心乡国遥。\n徒言欢满座，谁觉客魂消。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"畅当","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}